| `link-raise` / `carry-served` | AL-2: carry one `::linker` key |
| `abandon-pending` | AL-2: one `retire` call |
| `--dht-trust`, `:admission`, `:external` | KEEP, configuration |
| engine `:admission` registry record | KEEP |
