### Other requested checks

- **Language blindness:** Complete in the proposed linker protocol, slices, and acceptance. R2:10 deletes both importer keys and leaves the closed request-key set unchanged (`src/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1486`). AL-3’s holder context is composition-supplied; its principal/token meaning belongs to the supplied verifier. No frontend revision becomes code identity or authorization input.

