  2505	## 8. Evaluation
  2506	
  2507	### 8.1 Entry
  2508	
  2509	Loaded code enters a session by the flow of `yin.vm.linker.md` 7.2 and 7.3,
  2510	unchanged: the require parks on the link pair; the interpreter answers under
  2511	the request's id; the receiving task correlates, discharges obligations
  2512	against its own live state (step 5b), runs the install child, and lowers its
  2513	own bindings. This holds on all four VMs: each kernel names its format and
  2514	contract through `IModuleKernel/link-format`, and the `:fallback` policy of
  2515	`yin.vm.linker.md` 5.5 applies as composed.
  2516	
  2517	### 8.2 Pending and the re-check (R11)
  2518	
  2519	- A link the DHT source answers pending records, on the shell's pending
  2520	  run, the module manifest address whose load it waits on.

